# Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior: "Artifacts and creatures your opponents control enter tapped" applies to a token as it is
# created (CR 614.1d, 111.1). Bot1 casts Spider-Woman and its own Thraben Inspector: Bot1's Clue (an artifact token) enters
# untapped. On turn 2 Bot2's Thraben Inspector enters tapped, and so does the Clue it investigates for.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior
Thraben Inspector
Mox Pearl
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Thraben Inspector
Plains x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thraben Inspector.Cast
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Clue Token.Tapped = false
